| !HelloTriangle: the Raspberry Pi hello_triangle example (OpenGL ES 1.1
| through DispmanX), rebuilt from source against riscos-mesa.
| It runs in a desktop window and multitasks; close the window (or press
| any key) to quit.
Set HelloTriangle$Dir <Obey$Dir>
| riscos-mesa's DispmanX library shows the program's "display" in a desktop
| window, 640 pixels wide. To change that, set HelloTriangle$Display below to a
| size (e.g. 800x450) or to full for the whole screen, as on the Pi (then it
| doesn't multitask, and any key quits).
Unset HelloTriangle$Display
| Set HelloTriangle$Display full
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error !HelloTriangle needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0.00 RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0.00 Error !HelloTriangle needs ARMEABISupport
Run <HelloTriangle$Dir>.!RunImage
